    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "4 Bedroom Semi-Detached Home – 15 Aisling Heights, Raheen, Limerick\r\n\r\nJohn Giltinane & Associates are delighted to introduce to the market this attractive four-bedroom semi-detached residence, ideally located in the established and highly sought-after area of Aisling Heights, Raheen, Limerick.\r\n\r\nThis well-presented home has been tastefully decorated throughout, creating a warm, welcoming atmosphere while incorporating a modern charm that will appeal to a wide range of purchasers.\r\n\r\nOne of the standout features of this property is the substantially sized rear garden, offering excellent outdoor space for entertaining or simply enjoying the privacy of the mature rear grounds. The garden also benefits from a generously sized shed, which is plumbed and fitted with electricity, making it suitable for a variety of uses including a workshop, home office, hobby space or additional storage.\r\n\r\nThe property offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout and includes a welcoming entrance hallway, two reception/living areas, fitted kitchen, dining room, four bedrooms and two bathrooms.\r\n\r\nAccommodation:\r\nGround Floor\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway: 12.87' x 6.24'\r\nWelcoming entrance hallway providing access to the principal ground floor accommodation and staircase to first floor.\r\n\r\nSitting Room: 11.29' x 12.72'\r\nA bright and comfortable reception room featuring an open fireplace, creating a cozy atmosphere .\r\n\r\nFitted Kitchen: 10.62' x 8.93'\r\nFitted kitchen with ample workspace.\r\n\r\nDining Room: 11.89' x 7.86'\r\nWell-proportioned dining area with direct access to the rear garden.\r\nLiving Room: 9.47' x 9.95'\r\nA versatile additional reception room, offering excellent flexibility for modern living.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: 9.96' x 13.00'\r\nA generous ground-floor bedroom\r\n\r\nFirst Floor:\r\nMaster Bedroom: 12.31' x 12.37'\r\nSpacious master bedroom with the benefit of a private ensuite shower room.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 12.03' x 9.97'\r\nWell-proportioned double bedroom with the added benefit of a walk-in wardrobe. The wardrobe is already plumbed, offering excellent potential to convert this space into an ensuite.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: 9.25' x 7.49'\r\nComfortable additional bedroom .\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom: 6.15' x 6.98'\r\nFully fitted family bathroom which benefits from a new shower installation completed this year.\r\n\r\nOutside:\r\nThe property boasts a particularly large rear garden. The rear garden also benefits from a substantial shed with electricity and plumbing, providing a highly versatile additional space with potential for use as a workshop, hobby room or storage facility.\r\n\r\nLocation:\r\nAisling Heights is a well-established residential development situated in Raheen, Limerick, within easy reach of a wide range of local amenities and services. The property is conveniently positioned close to schools, shops, sporting facilities, public transport links and the University Hospital Limerick.\r\n\r\nViewing:\r\nThis property offers an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-presented four-bedroom home with generous accommodation with large rear garden in a popular residential location.\r\n\r\nContact John Giltinane & Associates today to arrange your viewing."
      },
